                "Linens and towels. Three sets per bed is what makes same-day turnovers possible, and they wear at commercial laundry rates. Budget continuous replacement rather than a periodic purchase.",
                "Outdoor furniture in harsh climates. Sun, salt and freeze all shorten the life substantially compared with residential use.",
